                            <comment id="16690190" author="moon" created="Sat, 17 Nov 2018 01:46:59 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thanks for reporting the issue.&lt;br/&gt;
0.8.0 deprecated z.input and renamed it to z.textbox. &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2395&quot; title=&quot;Refactor Input.java to make dynamic forms extensible&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-2395&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-2395&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
I assume you&apos;re using 0.7.x branch. From 0.8.0 both z.input, z.textbox will work.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Anyway, i agree. Documentation definitely need to be improved. I think keeping example and screenshot z.textbox, and mention z.input has deprecated 0.8.0 would reduce confusion.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
